{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "4158cf2f425542bda2a56159c6e88a3c", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "已生效订单中，已全量签收（所有批次都签收完毕）的订单有多少单？请用SQL统计，并给出你用的SQL语句和数字来源。", "id": "70e1c74fc1cc4c3c9de6fba7dc86bd11", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:20.001543", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "dafdbcc5e2ae431f9e5f0964cb2eefad", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_client_message_id": "c845adcd-3221-47a4-a1af-30227173cb8b", "qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:20.001582", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "金汉隆AI数据中枢智能体", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The user asks: among effective orders, how many orders are fully signed (all batches signed). Need SQL. Let me use the datahub skill.\n\nLet me first load the skill.", "id": "86bf6a7945c24d35b9cb9489206cad96", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:22.090081", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_def75245916a4843aae2d873", "name": "Skill", "input": "{\"skill\": \"datahub\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:22.733876", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_def75245916a4843aae2d873", "name": "Skill", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "# 金汉隆 AI 数据中枢技能\n\n本技能目录 `scripts/` 下四件工具（以本 SKILL.md 所在目录为根；若当前目录不是技能目录，先 find/glob 定位 `datahub/scripts/query.py`）：\n\n| 脚本 | 用途 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `scripts/query.py` | 对计算副本 `datahub/agent_data.sqlite` 执行只读 SQL（mode=ro，仅 SELECT/PRAGMA） | `python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders\"` |\n| `scripts/kb_search.py` | 检索《金汉隆-数据中枢》知识库（含30张表全量数据与口径文档） | `python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \"订单完成的口径是什么\"` |\n| `scripts/calc.py` | 均值 / 最小二乘斜率 / 变化率（支持 7 点均值、14 点回归场景） | `python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.47,0.45,0.42` |\n| `scripts/collect.py` | 多源采集演练：raw -> 标准化/去重/坏样本隔离 -> datahub/output/ | `python3 datahub/scripts/collect.py` |\n\n工作区数据目录 `datahub/`：`agent_data.sqlite`（计算副本）、`docs/`（schema/字段字典/口径/示例SQL）、`raw/`（采集源样本）、`output/`（输出目录，可写）。\n\n## 使用规则\n\n1. **数字必须来自 query.py / calc.py 的真实计算**，不得凭知识库片段心算全量汇总；知识库用于口径、字段说明与证据。\n2. 固定快照时间从 `configuration.snapshot_at` 读取（= 2026-09-18 08:00 北京时间），不得用机器当前日期。\n3. 只读纪律：query.py 以 mode=ro 打开数据库，不得写库、不得回写企业系统。\n4. 发送动作只允许 Mock 推送：`POST http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push`，`recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT`，带 `idempotency_key`（重复请求会被幂等忽略）。\n5. 输出附：订单号/工单号、时间窗口、单位、原始证据（SQL 或文档出处）；概率类输出标注\"演示评分，未校准\"。\n\n## 不适用场景\n\n- 与企业数据无关的通用闲聊/写作（直接回答即可）。", "id": "c8b311fab98643b9b397e2be93992ff6", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:22.866788", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:22.868838", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me look at the docs and schema first.", "id": "b7cc4ea53ee848379afc980d12d782d0", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:23.790873", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_2cda9c3638c840c0b9eb634a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"ls -la datahub/ datahub/docs/ 2>/dev/null\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:24.083308", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_d38022604ba8401f8c201f06", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \\\"全量签收 订单完成 口径 批次\\\" 2>&1 | head -80\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:24.603444", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_2cda9c3638c840c0b9eb634a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "datahub/:\ntotal 10964\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 16 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:59 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 root root 11202560 Sep 17 21:09 agent_data.sqlite\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 docs\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 output\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:09 raw\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 root root     4096 Sep 17 21:31 scripts\n\ndatahub/docs/:\ntotal 108\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 37870 Sep 17 21:09 schema.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  6514 Sep 17 21:09 业务口径要点.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 48930 Sep 17 21:09 字段字典.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   860 Sep 17 21:09 查询入门.sql", "id": "5fb3d7b93ed84fd48fe5e1b1f9e231b1", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:25.205881", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:25.207119", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_d38022604ba8401f8c201f06", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "根据检索到的业务口径要点，关于“全量签收”、“订单完成”及“批次”的口径定义如下：\n\n**1. 订单完成与全量签收的关系**\n*   **核心定义**：**订单完成 = 全量签收**。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"695b38a8-3cea-4455-81bc-a2cc27c6c8e3\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n*   **排除项**：订单完成**不是**指发货，也**不是**指质检通过。只有当最后一批货物全部签收后，才计入订单完成。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"695b38a8-3cea-4455-81bc-a2cc27c6c8e3\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n\n**2. 分批发货（批次）的处理逻辑**\n*   **累计计算**：对于分批发货的情况，需按运单数量进行累计。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"695b38a8-3cea-4455-81bc-a2cc27c6c8e3\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n*   **剩余数量计算**：部分发货时，剩余数量 = 订单总数量 - 已发数量。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"695b38a8-3cea-4455-81bc-a2cc27c6c8e3\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n*   **独立记录**：成品入库、发货、签收分别拥有独立的数量和时间记录，不可混淆。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"695b38a8-3cea-4455-81bc-a2cc27c6c8e3\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n\n**3. 风险预警中的相关口径**\n*   **延期事实判定**：若订单已超过承诺日期且**未全量签收**，则视为“延期已经发生”。此类情况应单独标记为“已发生的延期事实”，而不能包装成高准确率的预测结果。<kb doc=\"业务口径要点.md\" chunk_id=\"0a2074b6-8fba-4985-99cc-eb9b8d74acc0\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />", "id": "0a76f9bac72148f1a4536df8da99ab76", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:35.602824", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:35.604982", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now let's look at the schema for orders, shipments, sign-off (签收). Let me check the docs.", "id": "938bc4e91bb54677bf9a243839efee01", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:37.120303", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_58fca539735d451b8aa4b7fd", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub/docs && cat 业务口径要点.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:37.676642", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_06dfacb8ff614dfd842c9fad", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub/docs && cat 查询入门.sql\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:38.168294", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_58fca539735d451b8aa4b7fd", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "# 金汉隆 AI智能数据中枢 · 业务口径要点（供智能体检索）\n\n> 本文档为数据中枢智能体的口径与纪律说明，配套直读库 agent_data.sqlite 使用。\n\n## 固定模拟时间（重要）\n\n- **模拟时点：2026-09-18 08:00:00（Asia/Shanghai）**，必须从 `configuration.snapshot_at` 读取，不能用运行机器的当前时间。\n- 原始下单日期覆盖 2025-12 至 2026-09；每日经营序列覆盖 2025-12-01 至 2026-09-17（291 个完整自然日）。\n- 800 笔源订单中，**769 笔已生效；31 笔为未来样本**（未来样本不产生工单、生产、库存或物流流水）。只分析已生效订单。\n- 计划交期、供应商预计到货和预测交付可以晚于快照；实际开始、完工、出入库、签收等观测不能晚于快照。实际时间为空表示未发生（NULL 表示未发生或不适用，不是 0）。\n\n## 核心关联键与纪律\n\n- `orders.sales_order_id` 是订单主键；`work_orders.work_order_id` 是工单主键；生产、质检、仓储、物流、报工和异常记录同时保留订单号或工单号。\n- **禁止仅按合同编号跨表关联**：原表合同编号存在重号（如 \"20251217\" 对应两笔不同订单）。\n- 原表旧看板的 221 单口径不再采用；当前以源明细 800 单为准。\n- \"包装产品\"（packaged_goods）是客户要包装的食品、药品等，**不能当作本企业设备产量**；本企业设备/配件 SKU 以 products 为准。\n\n## 订单完成与进度口径\n\n- **订单完成 = 全量签收**（不是发货，不是质检通过）。分批发货按运单数量累计，只有最后一批全部签收才计完成。\n- 成品入库、发货、签收分别有独立数量和时间；部分发货的剩余数量 = 订单数量 - 已发数量。\n- 进度看板需区分：计划/加工或采购/装配/质检/发货状态；节点超时；未开始与进行中分开。\n\n## 跨部门融合口径（需求4）\n\n- **人效 = 标准工时产出 / 实际投入人时**；出勤人数按员工去重；**工时利用率 = 投入人时 / 出勤人时**；设备运行分钟不是人时。\n- **作业折算产值 = 标准工时产出 × 标准工时产值率**：是管理估值，**不是财务收入**；完工对应合同价值另列，两者不能混加。\n- 先按日期/工作中心等目标粒度**预聚合再联接**；禁止多事实表直接 JOIN 后 SUM（会造成金额翻倍）。\n\n## 库存与损耗口径\n\n- 原材料批次期初为 0，入库为正、出库为负（wms_transactions 的符号已标准化）。\n- 损耗出库和生产领料分开；**损耗率按成本计算，不跨物料单位相加**。\n- 订单成本 = 已发生的材料耗用 + 损耗 + 分摊人工 + 机台运行 + 物流（各分项四舍五入到分后汇总）；不含未发生采购、税费和全部销售行政费用。\n\n## 异常与报销口径（需求5）\n\n- 三个指标严格区分：**异常事件条数 / 新增异常工单数 / 日末未关闭异常工单数**。\n- 报销提交量按**报销单号去重**；不能把 OA 审批节点数当报销笔数。\n\n## 趋势分析口径（需求6）\n\n- 工作中心趋势按**\"最近有作业日\"**计算；企业实物完工趋势按**自然日**计算（停工日产量为 0）。\n- 默认下降规则：近 7 个点均值相对前 7 个点**下降超过 10%**，且近 14 个点**线性回归斜率为负**。\n- 物理产量按**台/套/件分别统计**，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\n- 不要仅从下降曲线断言原因，应结合设备报警、停机与报工记录核查；缺失采集不应被误记为停工零产出。\n\n## 风险预警口径（需求2）\n\n- 红色阈值 ≥0.65；黄色 ≥0.30 且 <0.65；其余绿色。\n- **已超过承诺日期且未全量签收的订单：延期已经发生**，单独标为\"已发生的延期事实\"，不能包装成高准确率预测。\n- 概率为**演示评分/经验概率**，未经真实数据校准，不得宣称生产环境准确率；条件尾部样本不足的外推必须披露。\n- 输出需含：概率或评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量与不足说明。\n\n## 采集口径（需求3）\n\n- WMS 方向决定正负号；MES 时间戳是毫秒、时长是秒；Excel 工时台账用**分钟**；需做单位与时间标准化。\n- 去重：事件按 `event_id` 识别重复；库存流水按 `transaction_id` 避免重复记账。\n- 同一工序的\"开始\"和\"完成\"事件不能仅因业务键相同就全部忽略，需结合 `event_at/sequence` 判断先后。\n- 重复接收同一事件时库存不得重复增减；脏数据隔离到独立区并出采集日志，干净数据不得引入孤儿订单、错单位、未来实际事件。\n- 遇到数量冲突、模糊交期、无效关联键时进入**人工复核**，不静默覆盖。\n\n## 六项需求对应的数据映射\n\n| 需求 | 输入事实表 | 应输出 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 订单进度看板 | orders、work_orders、stage_nodes、quality_inspections、wms_transactions、shipments | 计划/加工或采购/装配/质检/发货状态；节点超时；分批发货与全量签收；未开始与进行中分开 |\n| 2 交付风险预警 | 历史节点周期、历史签收时效、当前未完工节点、procurement_lines、logistics_events、exceptions | 延期概率/评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量 |\n| 3 多源自动采集 | ERP JSON、WMS JSONL、MES 日志、Excel 台账、OA JSON、微信订单图 | 字段映射、单位与时间标准化、去重、隔离异常、结构化入库及采集日志 |\n| 4 跨部门融合 | orders、labor_logs、attendance、employees、mes_events、wms_transactions | 订单量、出勤人数、人时、人效、作业折算产值、损耗成本、工时利用率 |\n| 5 每日8点简报 | shipments、exceptions、expenses、订单关联信息 | 前一自然日交付订单量、新增/未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额，一页简报及推送 |\n| 6 趋势分析 | labor_logs、attendance、mes_events、标准工时产出、成品入库（按台/套/件） | 7 点移动平均、14 点线性回归、下降提示与可追溯辅助证据 |\n\n## 禁止动作\n\n- 任何发送动作只能使用**包内 Mock 推送接口**（recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT），**禁止真实发信、真实微信推送或写回企业系统**。\n- 没有证据不要编造原因；概率无法校准时说明是演示评分/经验概率。", "id": "047748c36d1744709b6e0fb6ab745231", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:38.525101", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:38.527157", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_06dfacb8ff614dfd842c9fad", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "-- Query examples; run against agent_data.sqlite (read-only recommended).\n-- 1. Effective orders. Future examples are excluded.\nSELECT sales_order_id, work_order_id, customer_id, product_id, quantity, unit, promised_delivery_at\nFROM v_current_orders\nLIMIT 20;\n\n-- 2. Stock at warehouse / lot / item grain. Signed quantities are already normalized.\nSELECT warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id,\n       ROUND(SUM(signed_quantity),6) AS balance\nFROM wms_transactions\nGROUP BY warehouse_id,lot_id,material_id,product_id\nORDER BY warehouse_id,lot_id;\n\n-- 3. Observe schema before choosing columns and JOIN keys.\nPRAGMA table_info(stage_nodes);\nPRAGMA table_info(shipments);\nPRAGMA foreign_key_list(work_orders);\n\n-- Do not join multiple fact tables directly and then SUM.\n-- Aggregate labor, warehouse movements and freight separately to sales_order_id first.", "id": "c25199bda271411f9a92fbc67b312ffd", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:38.531745", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:38.534106", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now let's inspect the schema: orders, v_current_orders, shipments, and sign-off fields.", "id": "7e6edd5b719c40569f5864a9bb54a574", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:39.954723", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_6b0ba117a9f14b699f932f9f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT name, type FROM sqlite_master WHERE type IN ('table','view') ORDER BY type, name\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:40.545724", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_28ba939295fc4cf9a1083820", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(shipments)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:41.251107", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_28ba939295fc4cf9a1083820", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | shipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | carrier | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | tracking_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n7 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | dispatched_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | carrier_promised_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | received_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | freight_cost | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n12 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(13 rows)", "id": "d85e243b1504408bb0cb75cf7e2d4768", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:41.618772", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:41.621040", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_6b0ba117a9f14b699f932f9f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "name | type\n----------------------------------------\nattendance | table\nconfiguration | table\ncustomers | table\ndepartments | table\nemployees | table\nequipment | table\nexceptions | table\nexpenses | table\ningestion_runs | table\nlabor_logs | table\nlogistics_events | table\nmaterials | table\nmes_events | table\noa_forms | table\norders | table\nprocurement_lines | table\nproducts | table\nquality_inspections | table\nquality_issues | table\nroutes | table\nshipments | table\nsource_audit | table\nsource_documents | table\nsource_mappings | table\nstage_nodes | table\nsuppliers | table\nwarehouses | table\nwms_transactions | table\nwork_orders | table\nworkcenters | table\nv_current_orders | view\nv_inventory_balance | view\n(32 rows)", "id": "3430cc237e7e4b78b73a0a6a1a62e31a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:41.618994", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:41.626577", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "shipments: quantity (per batch), received_at (签收时间), status.\n\nNow orders table schema and v_current_orders view definition.\n", "id": "932d8bdb29c2461cbb908f931990d01e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:44.434115", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_95b94a7abdce4eb8a16c69dd", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(orders)\\\" && echo \\\"=== VIEW ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE name='v_current_orders'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:45.129919", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_0ff436142da64def8cd507a4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT status, COUNT(*) n FROM shipments GROUP BY status ORDER BY n DESC\\\" && echo \\\"=== null received ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) total, SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NULL OR received_at='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) no_recv FROM shipments\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:46.012260", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_0ff436142da64def8cd507a4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "status | n\n----------------------------------------\n已签收 | 724\n在途 | 22\n(2 rows)\n=== null received ===\ntotal | no_recv\n----------------------------------------\n746 | 22\n(1 rows)", "id": "4c3e8c82245e43bcb5eb61bc22117ed0", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:47.190539", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:47.192060", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_95b94a7abdce4eb8a16c69dd", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | order_line_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | contract_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | customer_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | product_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | packaged_goods | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n8 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | contract_amount | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n10 | created_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | promised_delivery_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n12 | delivery_basis | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n13 | route_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n14 | fulfillment_mode | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n15 | order_source | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n16 | source_risk_flag | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n17 | source_risk_reason | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n18 | sales_owner | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n19 | source_sheet | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n20 | source_row | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n21 | is_effective | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n22 | data_origin | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n23 | snapshot_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(24 rows)\n=== VIEW ===\nsql\n----------------------------------------\nCREATE VIEW v_current_orders AS SELECT * FROM orders WHERE is_effective=1 AND created_at <= (SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at')\n(1 rows)", "id": "5377566f1a6f41a7958e0143d029bbbc", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:47.196659", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:47.198215", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good. Shipments: 746 rows, 724 已签收 (with received_at), 22 在途 (no received_at).\n\nNow, \"全量签收\" = all batches signed. Interpretation options:\n1. Order has at least one shipment, and all shipments have received_at not null (status='已签收').\n2. Additionally, cumulative signed quantity = order quantity (全量 in terms of quantity).\n\nThe business definition: 订单完成 = 全量签收（分批发货按运单数量累计，只有最后一批全部签收才计完成）. Hmm, \"只有最后一批全部签收才计完成\" — meaning all batches signed. But strictly, 全量 could also mean quantity-wise complete: SUM(signed quantity) >= order quantity.\n\nLet me compute both and check for discrepancies. Also need to check whether orders table has multiple lines per sales_order_id (order_line_id). The question asks \"订单有多少单\" — count distinct orders (sales_order_id). Note 800 source orders, 769 effective. But orders table may have more rows than 800 if multiple lines. Let's check.\n\nAlso check whether quantity in shipments sums to order quantity.\n\nLet me run several queries.\n", "id": "3eea9d46dc1141afb94301416c81c09a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:48.776641", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_198b3c99a8a14ae4ba2d22ec", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) rows_, COUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id) orders_, SUM(is_effective) eff_rows, COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN is_effective=1 THEN sales_order_id END) eff_orders FROM orders\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:53.342275", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_154343204e9947ee96d16c27", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id) orders_with_ship FROM shipments\\\" && echo \\\"=== batches per order ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT n_batch, COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) n_batch FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id) GROUP BY n_batch ORDER BY n_batch\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:54.499188", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_198b3c99a8a14ae4ba2d22ec", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "rows_ | orders_ | eff_rows | eff_orders\n----------------------------------------\n800 | 800 | 769 | 769\n(1 rows)", "id": "3f277e0d5f674864ac9cb8ddf290252f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:55.792594", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:55.793975", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_154343204e9947ee96d16c27", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "orders_with_ship\n----------------------------------------\n702\n(1 rows)\n=== batches per order ===\nn_batch | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n1 | 658\n2 | 44\n(2 rows)", "id": "9e01fc06665e4b6abbf4d35480f5285d", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:55.818400", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:55.819701", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "800 orders, 1 row per order (sales_order_id unique). 769 effective.\n\nShipments cover 702 distinct orders; 658 with 1 batch, 44 with 2 batches.\n\nNow compute:\n- All-batches-signed orders among effective: orders where EXISTS shipment AND NOT EXISTS shipment with received_at null / status != 已签收.\n- Also quantity check: SUM(signed quantity) vs order quantity.\n\nLet me check quantity sums for the 44 two-batch orders and generally whether signed qty equals order qty.\n", "id": "8e0ffda3a0b647748ce2ff05d8701f7a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:56.853124", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_1bb8cd092e7b421394cfcec4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id,\\n         COUNT(*) AS batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' AND status='已签收' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS signed_batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' AND status='已签收' THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) AS signed_qty,\\n         SUM(quantity) AS shipped_qty\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id\\n)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS eff_orders,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_shipment,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS all_batches_signed,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_batches>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS all_signed_gt0,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.signed_batches=s.batches AND s.signed_batches>0 AND s.signed_qty>=o.quantity THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS all_signed_qty_full\\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:58.849726", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_a7df5605760a47559f8feac0", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id, SUM(quantity) shipped_qty, COUNT(*) batches FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.quantity, s.shipped_qty, s.batches, o.unit\\nFROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.shipped_qty <> o.quantity\\nORDER BY o.sales_order_id LIMIT 30\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:02.301742", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_1bb8cd092e7b421394cfcec4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "eff_orders | has_shipment | all_batches_signed | all_signed_gt0 | all_signed_qty_full\n----------------------------------------\n769 | 702 | 680 | 680 | 680\n(1 rows)", "id": "19ba18c6c70c4bf5ab03498112ad0b74", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:03.556625", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:03.558537", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_a7df5605760a47559f8feac0", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "sales_order_id | quantity | shipped_qty | batches | unit\n----------------------------------------\nSO20260814-0189 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 件\n(1 rows)", "id": "bca10810c60e457c9db72a563af05504", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:03.556808", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:03.562565", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Interesting: all_batches_signed = 680, and quantity-full also 680. But there's one order SO20260814-0189 where shipped_qty (1) < quantity (2) yet it's signed. Let's check whether it's in the 680 (it would be counted as all batches signed but signed_qty 1 < quantity 2 → all_signed_qty_full requires signed_qty>=quantity, so it would be excluded... but the count is 680 for both). Hmm, that means SO20260814-0189 is not all-batches-signed (it's 在途), so it's excluded from both. Let me verify.\n\nLet me check that order's shipments.\n\nAlso check: 702 - 680 = 22 orders with unsigned batches. And 22 在途 shipments — do they belong to 22 distinct orders? Let's verify. Also check whether status and received_at are consistent (any 已签收 with null received_at, or 在途 with received_at).\n\nAlso need to consider: are there shipments for non-effective orders (800-769=31 future orders)? 702 orders with shipments among effective. Let's check total distinct in shipments overall.\n\nAlso check: orders with no shipment at all = 769-702 = 67 → not signed.\n\nLet me also verify status/received_at consistency and the SO20260814-0189 case, plus whether any 已签收 has null received_at.\n", "id": "49acc2e9aec6411ea7915c30837d593a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:04.754491", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_407159b0cc6f4d6194785114", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT shipment_id, sales_order_id, quantity, unit, dispatched_at, received_at, status FROM shipments WHERE sales_order_id='SO20260814-0189'\\\" && echo \\\"=== consistency ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT status, SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NULL OR received_at='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) null_recv, SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) has_recv, COUNT(*) FROM shipments GROUP BY status\\\" && echo \\\"=== unsigned orders ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id) FROM shipments WHERE received_at IS NULL OR received_at='' OR status<>'已签收'\\\" && echo \\\"=== shipments on non-effective orders ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM shipments sh WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM v_current_orders o WHERE o.sales_order_id=sh.sales_order_id)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:10.657530", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_407159b0cc6f4d6194785114", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "shipment_id | sales_order_id | quantity | unit | dispatched_at | received_at | status\n----------------------------------------\nSH-MO20260814-0189-1 | SO20260814-0189 | 1 | 件 | 2026-09-15T08:00:00+08:00 |  | 在途\n(1 rows)\n=== consistency ===\nstatus | null_recv | has_recv | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n在途 | 22 | 0 | 22\n已签收 | 0 | 724 | 724\n(2 rows)\n=== unsigned orders ===\nCOUNT(DISTINCT sales_order_id)\n----------------------------------------\n22\n(1 rows)\n=== shipments on non-effective orders ===\nCOUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n0\n(1 rows)", "id": "8422f1e4f08343c6a875c84bfaa511b3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:13.787972", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:13.789271", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Clean data:\n- 746 shipments, 724 已签收 (all have received_at), 22 在途 (all null received_at), belonging to 22 distinct orders.\n- 702 effective orders have shipments; 680 have all batches signed; 22 have at least one 在途 batch.\n- 67 effective orders have no shipment at all.\n\nSo answer: 680 单 fully signed out of 769 effective orders (88.4%).\n\nLet me also double check the max received_at ≤ snapshot (data hygiene) and give the final SQL. Also verify that among the 680, quantity-wise full: signed_qty >= order quantity — yes 680.\n\nLet me also produce a breakdown: single-batch fully signed vs multi-batch fully signed. And check whether any of the 44 two-batch orders are fully signed.\n\nAlso verify snapshot_at value.\n\nLet me run one final verification query with breakdown.", "id": "1b87fa6aad034a118d041e27afc7e4c8", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:41.492089", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_f0a2ed32b0df40c285558c5e", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT config_key, config_value FROM configuration\\\" && echo \\\"=== breakdown ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH s AS (\\n  SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed_batches,\\n         MAX(received_at) last_signed_at\\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT s.batches, COUNT(*) orders_all_signed\\nFROM v_current_orders o JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE s.signed_batches=s.batches\\nGROUP BY s.batches\\\" && echo \\\"=== late sign check ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM shipments WHERE received_at > (SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at')\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:45.383446", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_f0a2ed32b0df40c285558c5e", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "config_key | config_value\n----------------------------------------\nsnapshot_at | 2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00\nbusiness_timezone | Asia/Shanghai\ndaily_brief_hour | 08:00\norder_completion_basis | 全量签收\nrisk_red_threshold | 0.65\nrisk_yellow_threshold | 0.3\nnode_red_grace_hours | 0\nexception_event_grace_hours | 4\nrisk_min_samples | 5\nrisk_simulation_trials | 512\ntrend_ma_window | 7\ntrend_slope_window | 14\ntrend_decline_threshold | -0.1\ncurrency | CNY\nopening_inventory | 0\nmock_seed | 20260918\nproduction_calendar | 周一至周六\nerp_poll_seconds | 60\nsource_lookup_key | sales_order_id/work_order_id\nsource_risk_usage | 仅保留原始标记\n(20 rows)\n=== breakdown ===\nbatches | orders_all_signed\n----------------------------------------\n1 | 636\n2 | 44\n(2 rows)\n=== late sign check ===\nCOUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n0\n(1 rows)", "id": "59e7f5993f684f57b2ed436722b538af", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:48.179708", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:48.181005", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "All 44 two-batch orders are fully signed; 636 of 658 single-batch orders are signed (22 在途 are single-batch). 636+44 = 680. ✓\n\nNow write the answer. Include the SQL, source, and caveats.\n\nNote: 全量签收 defined both by \"all batches signed\" and \"signed quantity = order quantity\" — both give 680, consistent. One order (SO20260814-0189) has shipped qty 1 < order qty 2 and is 在途, so excluded either way.\n\nAlso note: 67 effective orders have no shipment record at all → not signed.\n\nLet me present the final SQL cleanly.", "id": "c7d560acca484b079c407fba8c441fa0", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:49.389503", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "**结论：已生效 769 单中，已全量签收的订单 = 680 单（占 88.4%）。**\n\n## 用的 SQL（对 `datahub/agent_data.sqlite` 只读执行）\n\n```sql\nWITH s AS (\n  SELECT sales_order_id,\n         COUNT(*) AS batches,\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收'\n                   AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>''\n                  THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS signed_batches,\n         SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收'\n                   AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>''\n                  THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) AS signed_qty\n  FROM shipments\n  GROUP BY sales_order_id            -- 先按订单粒度预聚合，避免放大\n)\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS effective_orders,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_shipment,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN s.signed_batches = s.batches        -- 所有批次都签收\n                 AND s.signed_batches > 0\n                 AND s.signed_qty >= o.quantity          -- 数量上也全量\n                THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS fully_signed_orders\nFROM v_current_orders o\nLEFT JOIN s ON s.sales_order_id = o.sales_order_id;\n```\n\n返回：`effective_orders=769 | has_shipment=702 | fully_signed_orders=680`\n\n## 口径与判定依据\n\n- **订单完成 = 全量签收**，不是发货、不是质检通过；分批发货按运单数量累计，最后一批也签收完才算完成（出处：`datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md`；`configuration.order_completion_basis = 全量签收`）。\n- **已生效订单**用视图 `v_current_orders`（`is_effective=1 AND created_at <= snapshot_at`），快照时点取自 `configuration.snapshot_at = 2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00`，未使用机器时间。\n- **签收判定**：`shipments.received_at` 非空且 `status='已签收'`；一个订单的**全部**运单批次都满足才算全量签收。\n- **关联键**只用 `sales_order_id`，未按 `contract_no` 跨表 JOIN（合同号有重号）。\n\n## 数字来源与交叉校验（均为 query.py 实测）\n\n| 校验项 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| orders 总行数 / 去重订单数 | 800 / 800（一单一行，无多行拆单） |\n| 已生效订单 | 769（未来样本 31 单已排除） |\n| shipments 总批次 / 已签收 / 在途 | 746 / 724 / 22（`status` 与 `received_at` 完全一致，无矛盾行） |\n| 有发货记录的已生效订单 | 702（另 67 单无任何运单 → 未签收） |\n| 存在在途批次的订单 | 22 单（702 − 680 = 22，逐单对齐） |\n| 全量签收按批次数拆分 | 单批次 636 单 + 双批次 44 单 = **680** |\n| 数量口径复核 | `signed_qty >= quantity` 同样得 680；唯一发货量不足订单 SO20260814-0189（订单 2 件、已发 1 件）为在途，两种口径都排除 |\n| 签收时间越界检查 | `received_at > snapshot_at` 的记录 0 条 |\n\n**分母/单位**：单位=订单（单），时间窗口=下单至 2026-09-18 08:00（北京时间）。\n\n需要的话可以再拆一版：680 单按客户/产品/台·套·件分单位、或按签收月份的趋势，以及 89 单未全量签收（22 在途 + 67 无发货）的逾期事实清单。\n\n⟦ 已生效订单全量签收统计｜已完成：769 单中 680 单全量签收（单批636+双批44），SQL 与交叉校验已给出｜锚点：v_current_orders、shipments.received_at、snapshot_at=2026-09-18T08:00+08:00、SO20260814-0189 ⟧", "id": "4252cafa86d84b6799decc8fa0aa1b37", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:00:51.805956", "finished_at": null}], "role": "assistant", "id": "97109de4ae154cb6b2af9c41bc8426ff", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_turn_usage": {"usage": {"provider_id": "chinaunion", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "prompt_tokens": 168580, "completion_tokens": 3846, "total_tokens": 172426, "cache_read_tokens": 144640, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cache_eligible_input_tokens": 168580, "cache_observed": true, "cache_hit_rate": 85.7990271681101, "context_size": 1000000, "compact_threshold": 0.8, "session_cache_read_tokens": 144640, "session_cache_eligible_input_tokens": 168580, "session_cache_observed": true, "session_cache_hit_rate": 85.7990271681101}, "context_usage": {"estimated_tokens": 7476, "max_input_length": 1000000, "context_usage_ratio": 0.7476}}}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T21:59:22.854897", "usage": {"input_tokens": 168580, "output_tokens": 3846, "cache_input_tokens": 144640, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T22:01:04.772956", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "现在是每日 08:00 经营简报时间（北京时间）。请执行：\n1. 在 datahub/ 工作区运行 python3 datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py 生成前一自然日的经营简报。脚本会从计算副本读取数据、写入 datahub/output/，并通过包内 Mock 推送接口发送到 MOCK_MANAGEMENT（幂等键 daily-brief-<日期>，重复运行不会重复发送）。\n2. 汇报简报要点：全量交付单数、新增异常工单、日末未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额、当前未交付与逾期情况、WC02 人效变化；注明数据来源与快照口径（configuration.snapshot_at）。\n3. 若脚本报错或数字异常，说明原因并给出人工复核建议，不要编造。\n\n注意：所有发送只允许走 Mock 接口；不要写回企业系统。", "id": "15c473b68d2040e4b4587e24163c477e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:41.190678", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "f559b91a71984fd7b773bf5a58520be8", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:41.190719", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "金汉隆AI数据中枢智能体", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The user asks to run `python3 datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py`. Let me check if that script exists. Earlier the skill listed four scripts: query.py, kb_search.py, calc.py, collect.py. daily_brief.py may not exist. Let me check.\n\nIf it doesn't exist, I should say so honestly and offer to build the brief with SQL queries (which is within scope — the daily brief is one of my six capabilities). But careful: the user asked to run a specific script. If missing, I should report and either create it or do the analysis directly. Given the AGENTS.md says deliver results, and the daily brief is a core responsibility, I should probably build the brief from real SQL queries. But sending via Mock push — the user explicitly asked to run the script which pushes to mock endpoint. That's an external-ish action but explicitly requested and mock-only.\n\nLet me first check the scripts directory.\n", "id": "230a3ef462c44885a305dd397f646138", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:44.005491", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_118d422895274eb3b3a756d8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"ls -la datahub/scripts/ && echo \\\"=== output ===\\\" && ls -la datahub/output/\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:46.984569", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_748c4bdb324f4895ad32e48f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && ls raw/ && echo \\\"=== find daily_brief anywhere ===\\\" && find . -name \\\"*daily*\\\" -o -name \\\"*brief*\\\" | head -20\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:47.503022", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_748c4bdb324f4895ad32e48f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "erp\nevent_stream.jsonl\nevent_stream_retry.jsonl\nexcel\ningestion_bad_cases.jsonl\nmes\noa\nwechat\nwms\n=== find daily_brief anywhere ===\n./output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md\n./scripts/daily_brief.py", "id": "409c526396f747b29d4018c7d03b1c1f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:48.092306", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:48.093817", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_118d422895274eb3b3a756d8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "total 40\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Sep 17 22:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1890 Sep 17 21:31 calc.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 7953 Sep 17 21:31 collect.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 6916 Sep 17 22:19 daily_brief.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 4122 Sep 17 21:31 kb_search.py\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 2844 Sep 17 21:31 query.py\n=== output ===\ntotal 12\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Sep 17 22:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  534 Sep 17 22:19 daily_brief_2026-09-17.md", "id": "c83c294fa4724431b620a6e1e8e61cb3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:48.099941", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:48.100717", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The script exists (created at 22:18, modified 22:19) and there's already an output file `daily_brief_2026-09-17.md` (534 bytes, written 22:19). Interesting — it seems it was already run once? Or partially. Let me read the script first to understand what it does (important: check it only uses mock endpoint, doesn't write back to enterprise systems).\n\nLet me read the script and the existing output.\n", "id": "7a0d193fbc384778bbc1e1885225da1b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:50.228438", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5c2cc144b1c845b8bb73b5d5", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:51.653253", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_57e0fa9975254bd895228219", "name": "read_file", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:51.950072", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5c2cc144b1c845b8bb73b5d5", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"每日经营简报（前一自然日）生成 + Mock推送\n口径: 完成=全量签收; 新增异常工单=当日 opened 的工单去重; 日末未关闭=日末时点仍开放(opened<=EOD 且 未关闭或关闭时间>EOD)的工单去重; 报销按 submitted_at 当日去重.\n用法: python3 daily_brief.py [--db PATH] [--date YYYY-MM-DD] [--no-push]\n默认报告日 = 快照日期的前一天; 推送 Mock: http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sqlite3\nimport sys\nimport urllib.request\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\nMOCK_PUSH = \"http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push\"\n\n\ndef find_db(explicit=None):\n    here = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n    cands = [explicit] if explicit else []\n    cands += [\n        os.path.join(here, \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"datahub\", \"agent_data.sqlite\"),\n        \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/agent_data.sqlite\",\n    ]\n    for c in cands:\n        if c and os.path.isfile(c):\n            return c\n    raise SystemExit(\"agent_data.sqlite not found\")\n\n\ndef out_dir():\n    cands = [os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"datahub\", \"output\"),\n             os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), \"output\"),\n             \"/data/actions/zhizaoyun-datahub/output\"]\n    for c in cands:\n        try:\n            os.makedirs(c, exist_ok=True)\n            return c\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return \".\"\n\n\ndef run(db, report_day=None):\n    con = sqlite3.connect(f\"file:{db}?mode=ro\", uri=True)\n    q = lambda s, *a: con.execute(s, a).fetchall()\n    snap = q(\"SELECT config_value FROM configuration WHERE config_key='snapshot_at'\")[0][0]\n    if not report_day:\n        snap_date = snap[:10]\n        report_day = (datetime.strptime(snap_date, \"%Y-%m-%d\") - timedelta(days=1)).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n    D = report_day\n    EOD = D + \"T23:59:59+08:00\"\n\n    completed = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, MAX(received_at) last_at, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT sales_order_id, last_at FROM lr WHERE signed=batches AND last_at LIKE ? || '%'\"\"\", D)\n    new_wo = q(\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE ? || '%'\", D)[0][0]\n    open_wo = q(\"\"\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions\nWHERE opened_at<=? AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>?)\"\"\", EOD, EOD)[0][0]\n    reimb = q(\"SELECT COUNT(*), ROUND(COALESCE(SUM(amount),0),2) FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE ? || '%'\", D)[0]\n\n    unfinished = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT\n SUM(CASE WHEN s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches THEN 1 ELSE 0 END),\n SUM(CASE WHEN (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches) AND o.promised_delivery_at < ? THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN lr s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\nWHERE (s.sales_order_id IS NULL OR s.signed < s.batches)\"\"\", snap)[0]\n\n    eff = q(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM v_current_orders\")[0][0]\n    done = q(\"\"\"\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\n       FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM v_current_orders o JOIN lr s ON s.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id WHERE s.signed=s.batches\"\"\")[0][0]\n\n    # WC02 人效（近7有作业日 vs 前7）\n    eff_rows = q(\"\"\"SELECT work_date, SUM(earned_standard_hours), SUM(actual_hours)\nFROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date\"\"\")\n    series = [se / sa for wd, se, sa in eff_rows if sa]\n    mean = lambda xs: sum(xs) / len(xs) if xs else 0.0\n    r7, p7 = mean(series[-7:]), mean(series[-14:-7])\n    chg = (r7 / p7 - 1) * 100 if p7 else 0.0\n    con.close()\n\n    lines = [\n        \"【模拟经营日报｜%s】\" % D,\n        \"· 全量交付 %d 单（完成=全部批次签收）\" % len(completed),\n        \"· 新增异常工单 %d 单；日末未关闭异常工单 %d 单（工单去重）\" % (new_wo, open_wo),\n        \"· 报销提交 %d 笔，金额 %.2f 元\" % (reimb[0], reimb[1]),\n        \"· 当前未全量交付 %d 单（其中已逾期 %d 单）；已生效订单 %d 单、累计全量签收 %d 单\" % (unfinished[0], unfinished[1], eff, done),\n        \"· 加工二组WC02人效近7个有作业日均值 %.6f，较前7日 %.6f 变化 %.2f%%（下降需结合设备停机日志核查）\" % (r7, p7, chg),\n    ]\n    brief = \"\\n\".join(lines)\n    if completed:\n        brief += \"\\n· 当日完成订单：\" + \"、\".join(r[0] for r in completed)\n    result = {\n        \"report_date\": D, \"snapshot_at\": snap,\n        \"completed_orders\": len(completed), \"completed_list\": [r[0] for r in completed],\n        \"new_abnormal_work_orders\": new_wo, \"open_abnormal_work_orders_eod\": open_wo,\n        \"reimbursement_count\": reimb[0], \"reimbursement_amount\": reimb[1],\n        \"unfinished_orders\": unfinished[0], \"overdue_unfinished\": unfinished[1],\n        \"effective_orders\": eff, \"completed_total\": done,\n        \"wc02_recent7\": round(r7, 6), \"wc02_prev7\": round(p7, 6), \"wc02_change_pct\": round(chg, 2),\n        \"brief\": brief,\n    }\n    return result\n\n\ndef push(result, date_key):\n    body = {\n        \"idempotency_key\": \"daily-brief-%s\" % date_key,\n        \"recipient_group\": \"MOCK_MANAGEMENT\",\n        \"content\": result[\"brief\"],\n    }\n    req = urllib.request.Request(MOCK_PUSH, data=json.dumps(body, ensure_ascii=False).encode(\"utf-8\"),\n                                 headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}, method=\"POST\")\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=20) as resp:\n        return json.loads(resp.read().decode(\"utf-8\"))\n\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    ap.add_argument(\"--db\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--date\", help=\"报告日 YYYY-MM-DD（默认=快照日前一天）\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--no-push\", action=\"store_true\")\n    args = ap.parse_args()\n    db = find_db(args.db)\n    result = run(db, args.date)\n\n    d = out_dir()\n    md = os.path.join(d, \"daily_brief_%s.md\" % result[\"report_date\"])\n    with open(md, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(result[\"brief\"] + \"\\n\")\n    result[\"saved_to\"] = md\n\n    if not args.no_push:\n        try:\n            result[\"push\"] = push(result, result[\"report_date\"].replace(\"-\", \"\"))\n        except Exception as e:\n            result[\"push\"] = {\"error\": str(e)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1))\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n", "id": "d5ef046dbf0d4dbcbe47b147bf0888c4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:52.313974", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:52.315314", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_57e0fa9975254bd895228219", "name": "read_file", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "【模拟经营日报｜2026-09-17】\n· 全量交付 2 单（完成=全部批次签收）\n· 新增异常工单 9 单；日末未关闭异常工单 20 单（工单去重）\n· 报销提交 2 笔，金额 3943.27 元\n· 当前未全量交付 89 单（其中已逾期 12 单）；已生效订单 769 单、累计全量签收 680 单\n· 加工二组WC02人效近7个有作业日均值 0.469421，较前7日 0.676167 变化 -30.58%（下降需结合设备停机日志核查）\n· 当日完成订单：SO20260814-00447、SO20260815-00741\n", "id": "8563c48822584befbc440a7b3eb4fb7b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:52.314093", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:52.319238", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The script exists and appears to have been run before (output file exists). Note: the script writes to `datahub/output/` — that's allowed. It pushes to mock endpoint.\n\nImportant: the script's `find_db` uses mode=ro — good. But note the script does NOT filter completed orders by is_effective in the `completed` query (it uses shipments only). Let me check whether the 2 completed orders are effective orders. Also potential issues to verify:\n\n1. `completed` query: uses shipments, `last_at LIKE D%` — but doesn't join v_current_orders, so a future-sample order (non-effective) could be counted. We verified earlier shipments on non-effective orders = 0, so fine.\n\n2. `unfinished` overdue: `o.promised_delivery_at < snap` — uses string comparison; fine if format consistent.\n\n3. `new_wo` counts DISTINCT work_order_id from exceptions where opened_at on day D. But careful: exceptions may have NULL work_order_id? COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) ignores NULLs. Need to check.\n\n4. `open_wo`: opened_at <= EOD AND (closed_at NULL or > EOD). String comparison of ISO timestamps with same timezone offset works.\n\n5. reimb: COUNT(*) on expenses by submitted_at — the 口径 says 报销提交量按报销单号去重. The script uses COUNT(*), not COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id). Need to check if there are duplicate expense_id rows → potential inflation. This is a real check I should do.\n\n6. WC02 人效: series computed from all workdays, last 7 vs previous 7 — 口径 says \"最近有作业日\" for workcenter trends. The script groups by work_date so only days with labor logs. OK. But it doesn't cap at snapshot date — need to check if there are work_dates after snapshot (future). Let me check.\n\n7. Also 下降超过10% AND 14点回归斜率为负 for the \"decline\" rule — the script only reports the 7-point change. I can add regression slope check.\n\nLet me run the script now (as asked) and then verify numbers independently with SQL.\n\nLet me run it.", "id": "0dbc4152e2174eaf86607eafa1884596", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:55.823237", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_0c1d36192d3c4d6e8563db4a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd /root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent && python3 datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py 2>&1 | tail -40\", \"timeout\": 90}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:04.313360", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_0c1d36192d3c4d6e8563db4a", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n \"report_date\": \"2026-09-17\",\n \"snapshot_at\": \"2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00\",\n \"completed_orders\": 2,\n \"completed_list\": [\n  \"SO20260814-00447\",\n  \"SO20260815-00741\"\n ],\n \"new_abnormal_work_orders\": 9,\n \"open_abnormal_work_orders_eod\": 20,\n \"reimbursement_count\": 2,\n \"reimbursement_amount\": 3943.27,\n \"unfinished_orders\": 89,\n \"overdue_unfinished\": 12,\n \"effective_orders\": 769,\n \"completed_total\": 680,\n \"wc02_recent7\": 0.469421,\n \"wc02_prev7\": 0.676167,\n \"wc02_change_pct\": -30.58,\n \"brief\": \"【模拟经营日报｜2026-09-17】\\n· 全量交付 2 单（完成=全部批次签收）\\n· 新增异常工单 9 单；日末未关闭异常工单 20 单（工单去重）\\n· 报销提交 2 笔，金额 3943.27 元\\n· 当前未全量交付 89 单（其中已逾期 12 单）；已生效订单 769 单、累计全量签收 680 单\\n· 加工二组WC02人效近7个有作业日均值 0.469421，较前7日 0.676167 变化 -30.58%（下降需结合设备停机日志核查）\\n· 当日完成订单：SO20260814-00447、SO20260815-00741\",\n \"saved_to\": \"/root/zhiyun-ai-platform/apps/zhizaoyunAIOS/workspace/hub/runtimes/personal-49e1b686b8034127aaeb292f/working/workspaces/datahub-agent/datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md\",\n \"push\": {\n  \"status\": \"saved_to_local_outbox\",\n  \"message_id\": \"MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5\",\n  \"real_delivery\": false\n }\n}", "id": "6538d5afcb424c5c836deaf14fd5d8d3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:05.371083", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:05.372524", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The script ran successfully. Push returned `real_delivery: false` — mock only. Good.\n\nNow verify numbers independently. Key checks:\n\n1. 报销笔数: script uses COUNT(*) not COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id) — check schema of expenses and dedupe.\n2. 新增异常工单 9: check exceptions schema, work_order_id nulls, and whether \"异常事件条数\" vs \"新增异常工单数\" distinction holds.\n3. 日末未关闭 20.\n4. 逾期 12 单 — verify with independent SQL, and list them.\n5. WC02 人效 — check work_date range (no future dates beyond snapshot), and compute 14-point regression slope.\n6. 全量交付 2 单 — verify these are effective orders and their last batch signed on 2026-09-17.\n7. Check idempotency: run again? The user said repeated runs won't re-send. I could verify by checking... maybe not necessary to re-run push. Actually verifying idempotency would require another push call. It returned \"saved_to_local_outbox\". I'll not re-run to avoid duplicate sends; but the user said 幂等. I could test it — it's mock and idempotent by design. Better to avoid extra sends. I'll mention I didn't re-run.\n\nLet me do the verification queries.", "id": "2ef165dfc72446d498d9d95c8a884e7d", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:07.010029", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_79dabe41fb774089b8142fa5", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(expenses)\\\" && echo \\\"=== 报销 dedupe ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) rows_, COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id) distinct_ids, ROUND(SUM(amount),2) sum_all, ROUND(SUM(DISTINCT amount),2) FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\" && echo \\\"=== detail ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT * FROM expenses WHERE submitted_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:12.104248", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_fe783058345b4f8281d32b06", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(exceptions)\\\" && echo \\\"=== 9-17 exceptions ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) events, COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) wo, SUM(CASE WHEN work_order_id IS NULL OR work_order_id='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) null_wo, COUNT(DISTINCT exception_id) ex FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at LIKE '2026-09-17%'\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:13.941818", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_fe783058345b4f8281d32b06", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | exception_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | exception_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | severity | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | opened_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | closed_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | reason | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | source_record_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(10 rows)\n=== 9-17 exceptions ===\nevents | wo | null_wo | ex\n----------------------------------------\n9 | 9 | 0 | 9\n(1 rows)", "id": "ad0ee6d91e354aa4baa1e12630ce2e42", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:15.452197", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:15.452955", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_79dabe41fb774089b8142fa5", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | expense_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | employee_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | department_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | expense_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | amount | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n6 | currency | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | submitted_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | approved_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n9 | paid_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | status | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n11 | invoice_no | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(12 rows)\n=== 报销 dedupe ===\nrows_ | distinct_ids | sum_all | ROUND(SUM(DISTINCT amount),2)\n----------------------------------------\n2 | 2 | 3943.27 | 3943.27\n(1 rows)\n=== detail ===\nexpense_id | employee_id | department_id | sales_order_id | expense_type | amount | currency | submitted_at | approved_at | paid_at | status | invoice_no\n----------------------------------------\nREIM00174 | E030 | D03 |  | 运输垫付 | 1041.83 | CNY | 2026-09-17T14:00:00+08:00 |  |  | 审批中 | MOCKINV000174\nREIM00465 | E033 | D03 |  | 差旅 | 2901.44 | CNY | 2026-09-17T09:00:00+08:00 |  |  | 审批中 | MOCKINV000465\n(2 rows)", "id": "658898cf333f400b9c7b5e0170c79e23", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:15.483869", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:15.484978", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "报销: 2 rows, 2 distinct expense_id → no inflation. ✓ 金额 3943.27 ✓ (both 审批中, no sales_order_id — 运输垫付 + 差旅)\n\n异常: 9 events = 9 distinct work_order_id = 9 exception_id. ✓\n\nNow check 日末未关闭 20, and status field consistency (does status='已关闭' conflict with closed_at?).\n\nAlso check 逾期 12 单 and list them. And WC02 series + regression.", "id": "c5ff2d2468de466082d90a9ca5345620", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:17.638982", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_37c497484c644d7e83c84f13", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT status,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) no_close_time,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) closed_after_eod,\\n       COUNT(*) n\\nFROM exceptions WHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' GROUP BY status\\\" && echo \\\"=== EOD open count ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id) FROM exceptions WHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00')\\\" && echo \\\"=== status vs closed mismatch overall ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM exceptions WHERE (status='已关闭' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='')) OR (status<>'已关闭' AND closed_at IS NOT NULL AND closed_at<>'')\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:19.778583", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_c0c42335c0b74bb9bc96e198", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n   SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed\\n   FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.customer_id, o.quantity, o.unit, o.promised_delivery_at, lr.batches, lr.signed\\nFROM v_current_orders o LEFT JOIN lr ON lr.sales_order_id=o.sales_order_id\\nWHERE (lr.sales_order_id IS NULL OR lr.signed<lr.batches) AND o.promised_delivery_at < '2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00'\\nORDER BY o.promised_delivery_at\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:23.690183", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_c0c42335c0b74bb9bc96e198", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "sales_order_id | customer_id | quantity | unit | promised_delivery_at | batches | signed\n----------------------------------------\nSO20260702-0176 | C0220 | 1 | 台 | 2026-08-01T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260728-0181 | C0197 | 3 | 台 | 2026-08-17T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260807-00562 | C0198 | 3 | 件 | 2026-08-27T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260808-00752 | C0199 | 3 | 台 | 2026-08-28T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260814-0189 | C0167 | 2 | 件 | 2026-09-08T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260722-0179 | C0198 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-10T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260812-00619 | C0182 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-11T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\nSO20260824-00596 | C0069 | 4 | 套 | 2026-09-13T18:00:00+08:00 |  | \nSO20260805-0182 | C0194 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-14T18:00:00+08:00 |  | \nSO20260825-00401 | C0044 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-14T18:00:00+08:00 |  | \nSO20260826-00259 | C0166 | 2 | 台 | 2026-09-15T18:00:00+08:00 |  | \nSO20260818-0183 | C0059 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-17T18:00:00+08:00 | 1 | 0\n(12 rows)", "id": "59ce398ec3584ca88c46ce309dcac7f3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:25.843880", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:25.845303", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_37c497484c644d7e83c84f13", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "status | no_close_time | closed_after_eod | n\n----------------------------------------\n处理中 | 23 | 0 | 23\n已关闭 | 0 | 1 | 2325\n(2 rows)\n=== EOD open count ===\nCOUNT(DISTINCT work_order_id)\n----------------------------------------\n20\n(1 rows)\n=== status vs closed mismatch overall ===\nCOUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n0\n(1 rows)", "id": "08424a153a1649aa86b72d2dd7b95d83", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:25.912139", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:25.913503", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "逾期 12 单 confirmed. Note: 23 处理中 exceptions opened ≤ EOD, but 20 distinct work_order_id → some work orders have multiple exceptions. Let me check that: 23 rows / 20 distinct work_order_id. Also 1 exception closed after EOD (status 已关闭, closed_at > EOD) → counted as open at EOD. Good, that's the point-in-time logic.\n\nWait: 23 处理中 with no close time + 1 已关闭 closed after EOD = 24 rows open at EOD, but distinct work_order_id = 20. So 4 duplicates (same work order with multiple exception rows). Let me verify — this matters for the 口径 \"日末未关闭异常工单数\" (dedupe by work order). The script does dedupe → 20. But I should note that 异常事件条数 at EOD = 24 rows vs 工单数 20. Let me check the dup work orders.\n\nAlso check: are there exceptions with work_order_id NULL among open ones? Earlier null_wo=0 for 9-17. Let me check globally.\n\nAlso verify the 2 completed orders on 9-17: check their shipments and that they're effective.\n\nAnd WC02 人效: check work_date range, last dates, and compute 14-point regression slope.\n\nLet me batch these.", "id": "4dcf916dd86d4c2684d6f10125a84b10", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:27.288242", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_df6b9d0a47e24dc5adfa1164", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT work_order_id, COUNT(*) n, GROUP_CONCAT(exception_id) ids, GROUP_CONCAT(status) st\\nFROM exceptions\\nWHERE opened_at<='2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00' AND (closed_at IS NULL OR closed_at='' OR closed_at>'2026-09-17T23:59:59+08:00')\\nGROUP BY work_order_id HAVING n>1\\\" && echo \\\"=== null wo globally ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT SUM(CASE WHEN work_order_id IS NULL OR work_order_id='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) null_wo, COUNT(*) FROM exceptions\\\" && echo \\\"=== 9-17 completed orders ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT shipment_id, sales_order_id, quantity, unit, dispatched_at, received_at, status FROM shipments WHERE sales_order_id IN ('SO20260814-00447','SO20260815-00741') ORDER BY sales_order_id, dispatched_at\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:31.204271", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5601d8801183400fb0237e58", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COUNT(*) days, MIN(work_date), MAX(work_date) FROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02'\\\" && echo \\\"=== last 14 workdays ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT work_date, SUM(earned_standard_hours) earned, SUM(actual_hours) actual, ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours)/SUM(actual_hours),6) eff FROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY work_date ORDER BY work_date DESC LIMIT 14\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:34.083692", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5601d8801183400fb0237e58", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "days | MIN(work_date) | MAX(work_date)\n----------------------------------------\n4455 | 2025-12-02 | 2026-09-17\n(1 rows)\n=== last 14 workdays ===\nwork_date | earned | actual | eff\n----------------------------------------\n2026-09-17 | 28.9758 | 71.4874 | 0.405327\n2026-09-16 | 30.7143 | 73.6526 | 0.417016\n2026-09-15 | 30.0507 | 71.8658 | 0.41815\n2026-09-14 | 32.2049 | 71.0 | 0.45359\n2026-09-12 | 32.4307 | 65.0 | 0.498934\n2026-09-11 | 34.5024 | 64.7312 | 0.53301\n2026-09-10 | 34.4352 | 61.5 | 0.559922\n2026-09-09 | 31.1081 | 53.5 | 0.58146\n2026-09-08 | 30.045 | 49.0 | 0.613163\n2026-09-07 | 35.7666 | 57.0 | 0.627484\n2026-09-05 | 35.6499 | 52.25 | 0.682295\n2026-09-04 | 39.3645 | 54.5 | 0.722284\n2026-09-03 | 35.1566 | 46.5 | 0.756056\n2026-09-02 | 30.8779 | 41.1473 | 0.750423\n(14 rows)", "id": "046df65f0b92449695371ebf0f1555aa", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:35.498088", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:35.499375", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_df6b9d0a47e24dc5adfa1164", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "work_order_id | n | ids | st\n----------------------------------------\nMO20260805-0182 | 3 | EXM00581,EXM00584,EXM00585 | 处理中,处理中,处理中\nMO20260822-00303 | 2 | EXM00878,EXM00879 | 处理中,处理中\nMO20260822-00760 | 2 | EXM02223,EXM02224 | 处理中,处理中\n(3 rows)\n=== null wo globally ===\nnull_wo | COUNT(*)\n----------------------------------------\n0 | 2349\n(1 rows)\n=== 9-17 completed orders ===\nshipment_id | sales_order_id | quantity | unit | dispatched_at | received_at | status\n----------------------------------------\nSH-MO20260814-00447-1 | SO20260814-00447 | 1 | 台 | 2026-09-13T08:24:57+08:00 | 2026-09-17T08:24:57+08:00 | 已签收\nSH-MO20260815-00741-1 | SO20260815-00741 | 3 | 台 | 2026-09-12T19:20:28+08:00 | 2026-09-17T19:20:28+08:00 | 已签收\n(2 rows)", "id": "d02b04c1458d4c82a9b86320ecea92c3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:35.535521", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:35.536421", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Wait — `days=4455` for COUNT(*) — that's COUNT(*) of rows, not distinct days. Right, COUNT(*) rows = 4455. MIN/MAX work_date: 2025-12-02 to 2026-09-17 — max is 2026-09-17, ≤ snapshot date. Good, no future work dates.\n\nNote 2026-09-13 missing (Sunday? production calendar 周一至周六). 2026-09-13 is a Sunday. And 2026-09-06, 2026-09-19... consistent with Mon-Sat.\n\nNow the WC02 series: the script computes per-day ratio eff = earned/actual, then mean of last 7 vs previous 7. Last 7 days (09-10..09-17): 0.559922, 0.53301, 0.498934, 0.45359, 0.41815, 0.417016, 0.405327 → mean = ?\n\nLet me verify: sum = 0.559922+0.53301+0.498934+0.45359+0.41815+0.417016+0.405327 = 3.285949 → /7 = 0.4694213 ✓ matches 0.469421.\n\nPrev 7 (09-02..09-09): 0.750423+0.756056+0.722284+0.682295+0.627484+0.613163+0.58146 = 4.733165 → /7 = 0.676166 ✓ matches 0.676167.\n\nChange: 0.469421/0.676167 - 1 = -30.577% ✓ -30.58%.\n\nNow the 口径 for decline rule: 近7点均值相对前7点下降超过10% AND 近14点线性回归斜率为负. Let me compute the 14-point regression slope with calc.py.\n\nNote: the script's mean-of-ratios vs ratio-of-sums. 口径 says 人效 = 标准工时产出/实际投入人时. Computing per-day ratio then averaging is a valid \"daily 人效 series\" approach for trend. I'll note it as method.\n\nLet me run calc.py on the 14 daily efficiency values (oldest→newest) to get slope.\n\nAlso check: is there any equipment alarm/downtime evidence for WC02 to support the decline? 口径 says don't assert cause without evidence; check 设备报警、停机与报工记录. Let me look at mes_events / equipment for WC02 around 09-10..09-17. Let me check schemas quickly.\n\nAlso verify 未交付 89 = 769-680 ✓ (consistent with previous turn's answer).\n\nLet me run calc.py and check downtime evidence.", "id": "fc285fad3f594b45ac23d3625941187b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:37.015566", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_d47890f7bfda4dd1a0a06063", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/calc.py 0.750423,0.756056,0.722284,0.682295,0.627484,0.613163,0.58146,0.559922,0.53301,0.498934,0.45359,0.41815,0.417016,0.405327\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:46.332873", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_b17f38a362dd4cf98811e8e9", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(mes_events)\\\" && echo \\\"=== equipment cols ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(equipment)\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:47.812798", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_d47890f7bfda4dd1a0a06063", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"n\": 14, \"mean\": 0.572794, \"first\": 0.750423, \"last\": 0.405327, \"change_rate\": -0.459869, \"slope\": -0.029579}", "id": "cc0cda568ccd47b886a599b338f63df5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:48.305774", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:48.306661", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_b17f38a362dd4cf98811e8e9", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | mes_event_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | equipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | event_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | start_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | end_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | duration_minutes | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n9 | alarm_code | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | energy_kwh | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n(11 rows)\n=== equipment cols ===\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | equipment_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | equipment_name | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | rated_power_kw | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n4 | overhead_rate_per_hour | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n(5 rows)", "id": "8db6e2192efa43518b8679e700316df8", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:48.345032", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:48.345995", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Slope = -0.029579 (negative) over 14 points, and 7-point mean drop -30.58% > 10% → both conditions of the decline rule met → 触发下降提示.\n\nNow check downtime/alarm evidence for WC02 in the recent window vs previous window. Let me query mes_events for WC02 event types.", "id": "4a48c66baa3048beb84c5b65a537a052", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:53.354315", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_564ab4fa0575424090674664", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT event_type, COUNT(*) n FROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' GROUP BY event_type ORDER BY n DESC\\\" && echo \\\"=== WC02 alarm/downtime by week ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT CASE WHEN date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-10' AND '2026-09-17' THEN 'recent7'\\n            WHEN date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-09' THEN 'prev7' END win,\\n       event_type, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),1) mins\\nFROM mes_events\\nWHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-17'\\nGROUP BY win, event_type ORDER BY win, n DESC\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:54.736443", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5a02a7ba8a474b5290b988ac", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT CASE WHEN work_date BETWEEN '2026-09-10' AND '2026-09-17' THEN 'recent7' ELSE 'prev7' END win,\\n       COUNT(DISTINCT employee_id) heads, ROUND(SUM(actual_hours),1) actual_h, ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours),1) earned_h,\\n       ROUND(SUM(earned_standard_hours)/SUM(actual_hours),4) ratio_of_sums\\nFROM labor_logs WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND work_date BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-17'\\nGROUP BY win\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:57.366496", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5a02a7ba8a474b5290b988ac", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "win | heads | actual_h | earned_h | ratio_of_sums\n----------------------------------------\nprev7 | 10 | 353.9 | 238.0 | 0.6724\nrecent7 | 10 | 479.2 | 223.3 | 0.466\n(2 rows)", "id": "61edc4f84ac64d08a11f0630d39d75bc", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:59.290806", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:59.292014", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_564ab4fa0575424090674664", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "event_type | n\n----------------------------------------\nRUN | 4350\nDOWN | 639\n(2 rows)\n=== WC02 alarm/downtime by week ===\nwin | event_type | n | mins\n----------------------------------------\nprev7 | RUN | 119 | 3350.0\nprev7 | DOWN | 118 | 3540.0\nrecent7 | RUN | 157 | 4477.5\nrecent7 | DOWN | 156 | 4680.0\n(4 rows)", "id": "03f8e9763c9c4030be1e41e1e4d503b7", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:59.326340", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:20:59.327102", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good supporting evidence:\n- WC02 downtime minutes rose from 3540.0 (prev7) to 4680.0 (recent7), +32.2%; DOWN events 118→156.\n- Actual hours rose 353.9 → 479.2 (+35.4%) while earned standard hours fell 238.0 → 223.3 (-6.2%). So the drop is driven by more input hours with less standard-hour output.\n- Headcount same (10 distinct employees) → 人时增加，说明出勤人时/加班增加.\n\nLet me compute the % changes with calc.py for accuracy. Actually simple: 4680/3540-1 = 32.20%; 479.2/353.9-1 = 35.41%; 223.3/238.0-1 = -6.18%. I should use calc.py per discipline for any 汇总/占比/均值/斜率. These are change rates — let me run calc.py to be rigorous.\n\nAlso ratio_of_sums gives 0.466 vs 0.6724 → -30.7%, close to mean-of-ratios -30.58%. Consistent either way. Good — I'll note both.\n\nLet me also check: is there an alarm_code presence in DOWN events? And check whether the recent window includes 09-13 (Sunday, no work). Fine.\n\nLet me run calc for the three change rates, and check DOWN alarm codes distribution.\n\nAlso one more check for the brief: 全量交付 2 单 on 9-17 — verify both are effective orders (they should be; earlier we found 0 shipments on non-effective orders). And check that no other order had its LAST batch signed on 9-17 but was missed... the script's query is exactly that. Also check: any order whose received_at is on 9-17 but not fully signed (partial) — those aren't \"全量交付\". Let me count orders with any signing event on 9-17.\n\nLet me batch final checks.", "id": "88524ea07636463db2392bde8c53f6f3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:00.708931", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_26ec5ef74e0a45de9c508007", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/calc.py 3540,4680 && python3 scripts/calc.py 353.9,479.2 && python3 scripts/calc.py 238.0,223.3 && python3 scripts/calc.py 0.6724,0.466\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:08.292740", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_d57ed854546f4d9593c986dc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n   SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed,\\n   MAX(received_at) last_at\\n   FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) orders_any_sign_0917,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN signed=batches THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) fully_signed_0917\\nFROM lr WHERE received_at IS NOT NULL AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM shipments sh WHERE sh.sales_order_id=lr.sales_order_id AND sh.received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%')\\\" && echo \\\"=== DOWN alarm codes recent ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COALESCE(alarm_code,'(null)') code, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),0) mins FROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-10' AND '2026-09-17' GROUP BY code ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 8\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:09.388930", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_d57ed854546f4d9593c986dc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command failed with exit code 1.\n[stderr]\nSQL ERROR: no such column: received_at", "id": "b407fe696088488eb432b77c421db440", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:12.550702", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:12.551868", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_26ec5ef74e0a45de9c508007", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"n\": 2, \"mean\": 4110.0, \"first\": 3540.0, \"last\": 4680.0, \"change_rate\": 0.322034, \"slope\": 1140.0}\n{\"n\": 2, \"mean\": 416.55, \"first\": 353.9, \"last\": 479.2, \"change_rate\": 0.354055, \"slope\": 125.3}\n{\"n\": 2, \"mean\": 230.65, \"first\": 238.0, \"last\": 223.3, \"change_rate\": -0.061765, \"slope\": -14.7}\n{\"n\": 2, \"mean\": 0.5692, \"first\": 0.6724, \"last\": 0.466, \"change_rate\": -0.30696, \"slope\": -0.2064}", "id": "fc5ed90b3ae84be693b2ff4417d897f4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:12.605295", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:12.606544", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The first query had an error (WHERE received_at IS NOT NULL at outer level — lr has last_at not received_at). Let me fix.", "id": "92ecbd6e87874780bcc6ca3984a138f5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:14.130949", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_58fc36df12ec4b3689d3778c", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH lr AS (SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches,\\n   SUM(CASE WHEN status='已签收' AND received_at IS NOT NULL AND received_at<>'' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) signed,\\n   MAX(received_at) last_at\\n   FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\\nSELECT COUNT(*) orders_with_signing_event_0917,\\n       SUM(CASE WHEN signed=batches AND last_at LIKE '2026-09-17%' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) fully_signed_on_0917\\nFROM lr WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM shipments sh WHERE sh.sales_order_id=lr.sales_order_id AND sh.received_at LIKE '2026-09-17%')\\\" && echo \\\"=== DOWN alarm codes recent7 ===\\\" && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COALESCE(alarm_code,'(null)') code, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),0) mins FROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-10' AND '2026-09-17' GROUP BY code ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 8\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:14.830325", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_58fc36df12ec4b3689d3778c", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "orders_with_signing_event_0917 | fully_signed_on_0917\n----------------------------------------\n2 | 2\n(1 rows)\n=== DOWN alarm codes recent7 ===\ncode | n | mins\n----------------------------------------\nALM-ALIGN-07 | 156 | 4680.0\n(1 rows)", "id": "a05091c439e14485b697a4a45d412f03", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:18.287182", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:18.288407", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "All verified. \n\n- 9-17 有签收动作的订单 = 2, 全部为全量签收 → 全量交付 2 单 ✓ (no partial-signature orders missed)\n- WC02 DOWN events in recent7: all alarm_code ALM-ALIGN-07, 156 events, 4680 minutes.\n\nLet me also check prev7 alarm code for comparison to see if it's the same code (i.e., a persistent issue) — quick check. And also confirm the mock push endpoint behavior/idempotency: the response said \"saved_to_local_outbox\", real_delivery false. Should I test idempotency by re-running? The user said repeated runs won't duplicate. I already ran once (and there was a prior run at 22:19 — the file existed before my run, and the push message_id is new: MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5). Hmm, actually the prior run may have been from setup. Let me check the outbox to see if there are duplicate entries — is there an outbox file somewhere? \"saved_to_local_outbox\" suggests the mock server writes to a local outbox. Let me look for it to verify idempotency behavior. That's read-only inspection.\n\nLet me find the outbox.", "id": "fc983fb0edc84682bbf70dcc75524a45", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:19.714955", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_db1dc8d4208d46a281b4f381", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"cd datahub && python3 scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT COALESCE(alarm_code,'(null)') code, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(SUM(duration_minutes),0) mins FROM mes_events WHERE workcenter_id='WC02' AND event_type='DOWN' AND date(start_at) BETWEEN '2026-09-02' AND '2026-09-09' GROUP BY code ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 5\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:24.125165", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_284183f70a394d9fbdd3e8a3", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"find / -name \\\"*outbox*\\\" -not -path \\\"*/proc/*\\\" 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo \\\"=== mock api? ===\\\"; curl -s -m 5 -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\\\"idempotency_key\\\":\\\"daily-brief-20260917\\\",\\\"recipient_group\\\":\\\"MOCK_MANAGEMENT\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"idempotency probe (duplicate of daily brief)\\\"}' 2>&1 | head -5\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:25.492394", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_db1dc8d4208d46a281b4f381", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "code | n | mins\n----------------------------------------\nALM-ALIGN-07 | 118 | 3540.0\n(1 rows)", "id": "a012709f0bf24d968935187c87464e15", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:27.091924", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:27.092895", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_284183f70a394d9fbdd3e8a3", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "=== mock api? ===\n{\"status\": \"duplicate_ignored\", \"message_id\": \"MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5\", \"real_delivery\": false}", "id": "18fa25682c32477b980cff53dac2ef8c", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:28.997320", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:28.998329", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Idempotency verified: re-sending with the same key `daily-brief-20260917` returned `duplicate_ignored` with the same message_id MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5, real_delivery=false. \n\nNote: I did send a probe to the mock endpoint — that's within the allowed mock-only channel and the same idempotency key, so it was ignored. Fine, and it confirms the user's claim. I should mention I probed the mock endpoint with the same idempotency key (no duplicate message created).\n\nNow write the report. All numbers verified.\n\nSummary of the brief:\n- 报告日: 2026-09-17 (前一自然日), 快照 2026-09-18T08:00+08:00\n- 全量交付 2 单: SO20260814-00447 (1台, 签收 09-17 08:24), SO20260815-00741 (3台, 签收 09-17 19:20)\n- 新增异常工单 9 单 (9 events = 9 distinct work orders, no null wo)\n- 日末未关闭异常工单 20 单 (24 open exception rows → 20 distinct work orders; 3 work orders have multiple: MO20260805-0182 ×3, MO20260822-00303 ×2, MO20260822-00760 ×2; includes 1 已关闭 but closed after EOD)\n- 报销 2 笔 3943.27 元 (REIM00174 运输垫付 1041.83, REIM00465 差旅 2901.44, both 审批中, 无订单关联)\n- 未全量交付 89 单, 其中已逾期 12 单 (list)\n- 累计: 已生效 769, 全量签收 680 (88.4%)\n- WC02 人效: 近7有作业日 0.469421 vs 前7 0.676167, -30.58%; 14点回归斜率 -0.029579 <0 → 触发下降规则\n  - 辅助证据: DOWN 3540→4680 min (+32.20%), 全部 ALM-ALIGN-07; 投入人时 353.9→479.2 (+35.41%), 标准工时产出 238.0→223.3 (-6.18%), 出勤人数均 10 人; ratio-of-sums 口径 0.6724→0.466 (-30.70%) 同向\n\nAnomalies / 人工复核建议:\n1. 报销笔数脚本用 COUNT(*) 而非按 expense_id 去重 —— 本次恰好 2 行=2 个单号，无影响；但口径要求按报销单号去重，建议改脚本。\n2. MO20260805-0182 一个工单 3 条未关闭异常 —— 事件条数 vs 工单数差异，简报里两个指标要分开。\n3. 逾期 12 单中 5 单完全没有发货记录 (SO20260824-00596, SO20260805-0182, SO20260825-00401, SO20260826-00259) — wait let me recount: batches NULL: SO20260824-00596, SO20260805-0182, SO20260825-00401, SO20260826-00259 → 4 单无发货记录; 8 单有发货但未签收(在途). Let me verify: 12 rows, 4 with NULL batches → 8 with batches=1, signed=0 (在途).\n   Actually earlier we found 22 在途 orders total; 8 of them are overdue.\n4. SO20260814-0189 数量冲突: 订单 2 件, 只发 1 件且在途 → 剩余 1 件未发, 交期已过 → 人工复核（发货量不足）。\n5. SO20260805-0182 同时出现在逾期清单和未关闭异常工单 (MO20260805-0182 3条异常) → 优先复核。\n6. 当日全量交付仅 2 单，样本小，不宜据此判断趋势。\n7. 67 单无任何运单记录（未全量交付 89 = 22 在途 + 67 无发货）—— 其中 4 单已逾期。\n\nLet me double check the 67 vs 89: 89 未全量交付 = 22 (有在途批次) + 67 (无运单). And overdue 12 = 8 在途 + 4 无运单. ✓ consistent with the list (4 NULL batches rows).\n\nAlso note: script's `completed` query doesn't restrict to effective orders, but verified 0 shipments on non-effective orders → no impact this time. Worth flagging as a robustness note.\n\nAlso: 全量签收 680 matches previous turn.\n\nNow format the answer. Conclusion first, then details, evidence, and 复核建议. Include the file path and push result.\n\nHeadline at the end.\n", "id": "83ce924ed4a14ac79c84b156ea9b5add", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:30.816237", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "**简报已生成并 Mock 推送成功**（`real_delivery: false`，幂等键 `daily-brief-20260917`，消息号 `MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5`）。所有数字我都用独立 SQL 复核过，与脚本一致；发现 3 处口径/数据问题需人工复核（见末尾）。\n\n## 【模拟经营日报｜2026-09-17】\n\n| 指标 | 数值 | 复核 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 全量交付（当日完成）订单 | **2 单** | SO20260814-00447（1 台，签收 09-17 08:24）、SO20260815-00741（3 台，签收 09-17 19:20）；当日有签收动作的订单共 2 单，无\"部分签收\"漏计 |\n| 新增异常工单 | **9 单** | 9-17 opened 的异常事件 9 条 = 9 个去重工单 = 9 个 exception_id，无空工单号 |\n| 日末未关闭异常工单 | **20 单** | 时点口径（opened_at ≤ 09-17 23:59:59 且未关闭或关闭于 EOD 之后）：24 条异常事件 → 去重后 20 个工单 |\n| 报销提交 | **2 笔 / 3943.27 元** | REIM00465 差旅 2901.44 + REIM00174 运输垫付 1041.83，均\"审批中\"，无订单关联 |\n| 当前未全量交付 | **89 单**（22 单有在途批次 + 67 单无任何运单） | = 769 − 680，与上一轮统计自洽 |\n| 其中已逾期（事实，非预测） | **12 单** | 8 单在途未签收 + 4 单无发货记录 |\n| 累计进度 | 已生效 769 单，全量签收 **680 单（88.4%）** | 与上一轮 SQL 结果一致 |\n| WC02 人效 | 近 7 个有作业日 **0.469421**，前 7 日 **0.676167**，**−30.58%** | 14 点回归斜率 **−0.029579**（负）→ 同时满足\"降幅>10% 且斜率为负\"，**下降提示成立** |\n\n**WC02 下降的可追溯辅助证据**（不推断原因，仅列事实）：\n- 停机：DOWN 事件 118 次/3540 分 → 156 次/**4680 分（+32.20%）**，两个窗口全部为同一告警码 `ALM-ALIGN-07`。\n- 投入产出：实际人时 353.9 → 479.2 h（**+35.41%**），标准工时产出 238.0 → 223.3 h（**−6.18%**），出勤人数两窗口均为 10 人。\n- 换一种算法（比值合算 Σ产出/Σ人时）：0.6724 → 0.466，−30.70%，与脚本的\"日均值再平均\"同向，结论不依赖算法选择。\n\n## 来源与口径\n\n- 数据源：`datahub/agent_data.sqlite`（`daily_brief.py` 以 `mode=ro` 只读打开）；输出文件 `datahub/output/daily_brief_2026-09-17.md`。\n- 时间基准：`configuration.snapshot_at = 2026-09-18T08:00:00+08:00`（Asia/Shanghai），报告日 = 快照前一自然日 2026-09-17；未使用机器时间。\n- 完成 = 全量签收（`order_completion_basis`），分批发货按运单累计、最后一批签收才计完成；订单只取 `v_current_orders`（`is_effective=1 AND created_at ≤ snapshot_at`）；关联键仅 `sales_order_id`/`work_order_id`，未按合同号跨表 JOIN。\n- 三个异常指标严格区分：异常事件条数 / 新增异常工单数 / 日末未关闭异常工单数（后两者按 `work_order_id` 去重）。\n- 台/套/件未跨单位相加；逾期 12 单为**已发生事实**，不是预测评分。\n- 幂等验证：我用同一幂等键向 Mock 接口再发一次，返回 `{\"status\":\"duplicate_ignored\",\"message_id\":\"MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5\"}`，未产生重复消息；全程未写回企业系统。\n\n## 需要人工复核的 3 项（不静默覆盖）\n\n1. **脚本口径瑕疵（本次无影响，建议修）**：`daily_brief.py` 的报销笔数用 `COUNT(*)` 而非 `COUNT(DISTINCT expense_id)`，与\"按报销单号去重\"的口径不符——本次 2 行恰好 2 个单号，数字未失真；若源表出现重复行会虚高。同样，`completed` 查询只查 `shipments` 未联 `v_current_orders`，本次经核 `shipments` 中无未生效订单（0 条），结果不受影响，但建议补上过滤。\n2. **数量冲突**：`SO20260814-0189`（C0167，2 件）承诺 2026-09-08，仅发货 1 件且仍\"在途\"，剩余 1 件无发货记录 → 属\"发货量不足 + 已逾期\"，需销售/仓储核对是否漏发。\n3. **交叉风险单**：`SO20260805-0182`（C0194，1 台，承诺 09-14）既无任何运单，其工单 `MO20260805-0182` 还挂着 **3 条未关闭异常**（EXM00581/00584/00585），是 12 单逾期里风险最集中的一单，建议优先处理。另 `MO20260822-00303`、`MO20260822-00760` 各有 2 条未关闭异常——这也是\"24 条事件 vs 20 个工单\"差异的来源。\n\n补充说明：当日全量交付仅 2 单，样本太小，不宜据此判断交付趋势；WC02 的 `ALM-ALIGN-07` 告警连续两周为唯一停机码，值得设备/工艺侧单独排查（数据只支持\"相关\"，不支持\"归因\"）。\n\n⟦ 每日08点经营简报2026-09-17｜已完成：daily_brief.py 运行+Mock推送(MOCKMSG-c490b11a12a5, duplicate_ignored验证幂等)，交付2单/新增异常工单9/日末未关闭20/报销2笔3943.27元/未交付89含逾期12/WC02人效-30.58%(斜率-0.029579, ALM-ALIGN-07停机+32.20%)｜待复核：脚本报销未按expense_id去重、SO20260814-0189发货量不足、SO20260805-0182挂3条未关闭异常 ⟧", "id": "00e11747c06b430bb65c1f69aa96ba95", "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:21:50.730265", "finished_at": null}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ea0a66bec1994856a3540ccb99bae020", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:19:48.071814", "usage": {"input_tokens": 352686, "output_tokens": 9631, "cache_input_tokens": 312448, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T22:22:18.476522", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "现在是每日 08:00 经营简报时间（北京时间）。请执行：\n1. 在 datahub/ 工作区运行 python3 datahub/scripts/daily_brief.py 生成前一自然日的经营简报。脚本会从计算副本读取数据、写入 datahub/output/，并通过包内 Mock 推送接口发送到 MOCK_MANAGEMENT（幂等键 daily-brief-<日期>，重复运行不会重复发送）。\n2. 汇报简报要点：全量交付单数、新增异常工单、日末未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额、当前未交付与逾期情况、WC02 人效变化；注明数据来源与快照口径（configuration.snapshot_at）。\n3. 若脚本报错或数字异常，说明原因并给出人工复核建议，不要编造。\n\n注意：所有发送只允许走 Mock 接口；不要写回企业系统。", "